# Keep Docker build contexts small (Engineering Standards §17).
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/*.log
docs/
*.md
.editorconfig
